-- a solicitor or advocate in Scotland (limb (c))
#ASSERT (`sch 2 part 2(A) para 52(2) the person is a lawyer` WITH `section 18 of the Legal Services Act 2007 has come into force` IS FALSE, `the person is an authorised person in relation to an activity that constitutes a reserved legal activity (within the meaning of the Legal Services Act 2007)` IS FALSE, `the person is a solicitor or barrister in England and Wales` IS FALSE, `the person is a solicitor or barrister in Northern Ireland` IS FALSE, `the person is a solicitor or advocate in Scotland` IS TRUE, `the person is a member, and entitled to practise as such, of a legal profession regulated in a jurisdiction outside the United Kingdom` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
