§§ `The Schedule's own words for a description (a lookup, tested against the lines of the text)`

-- (A) para 1: line(s) [19124] of the text
#ASSERT `sch 2 part 2 the words of the description` `sch 2 part 2(A) para 1 a person authorised under section 457 of this Act` EQUALS "A disclosure for the purpose of enabling or assisting a person authorised under section 457 of this Act (revision of defective accounts: persons authorised to apply to court) to exercise their functions."
-- (A) para 22: line(s) [19157] of the text
#ASSERT `sch 2 part 2 the words of the description` `sch 2 part 2(A) para 22 the Bank of England` EQUALS "A disclosure for the purpose of enabling or assisting the Bank of England to exercise its functions."
-- (A) para 36A: line(s) [19188] of the text
#ASSERT `sch 2 part 2 the words of the description` `sch 2 part 2(A) para 36A the lead enforcement authority under the Estate Agents Act 1979` EQUALS "A disclosure for the purpose of enabling or assisting the lead enforcement authority (as defined in section 33(1) of the Estate Agents Act 1979) to exercise its functions under the Estate Agents Act 1979."
-- (A) para 53: line(s) [19225] of the text
#ASSERT `sch 2 part 2 the words of the description` `sch 2 part 2(A) para 53 disciplinary proceedings about a public servant` EQUALS "A disclosure with a view to the institution of, or otherwise for the purposes of, disciplinary proceedings relating to the performance by a public servant of their duties."
-- (A) para 13(a): line(s) [19136, 19137] of the text
#ASSERT `sch 2 part 2 the words of the description` `sch 2 part 2(A) para 13(a) the Secretary of State or the Treasury - functions under the Companies Acts` EQUALS "A disclosure for the purpose of enabling or assisting the Secretary of State or the Treasury to exercise any of their functions under any of the following— (a) the Companies Acts;"
-- (A) para 37(aa): line(s) [19189, 19191] of the text
#ASSERT `sch 2 part 2 the words of the description` `sch 2 part 2(A) para 37(aa) the FCA or the PRA - functions under the Consumer Credit Act 1974` EQUALS "A disclosure for the purpose of enabling or assisting the Financial Conduct Authority or the Prudential Regulation Authority to exercise its functions under any of the following— (aa) the Consumer Credit Act 1974;"
-- (A) para 25(m)(iii): line(s) [19160, 19173, 19176] of the text
#ASSERT `sch 2 part 2 the words of the description` `sch 2 part 2(A) para 25(m)(iii) the Competition and Markets Authority - functions under Chapter 2 of Part 5 of the 2024 Act` EQUALS "A disclosure for the purpose of enabling or assisting the Competition and Markets Authority to exercise its functions under any of the following— (m) the following provisions of the Digital Markets, Competition and Consumers Act 2024— (iii) Chapter 2 of Part 5."
-- (B) para 4(c): line(s) [19233, 19236] of the text
#ASSERT `sch 2 part 2 the words of the description` `sch 2 part 2(B) para 4(c) the Minister for Economic Development - functions under the Financial Services (Jersey) Law 1998` EQUALS "A disclosure for the purpose of enabling or assisting the Minister for Economic Development to exercise functions under any of the following— (c) the Financial Services (Jersey) Law 1998."
-- (C) para 2(g): line(s) [19257, 19264] of the text
#ASSERT `sch 2 part 2 the words of the description` `sch 2 part 2(C) para 2(g) a person appointed under section 19 of the Registration of Non-Regulated Financial Services Business Law 2008` EQUALS "A disclosure for the purpose of enabling or assisting a person appointed under— (g) section 19 of the Registration of Non-Regulated Financial Services Business (Bailiwick of Guernsey) Law 2008,"
-- (D) para 9(b): line(s) [19291, 19293] of the text
#ASSERT `sch 2 part 2 the words of the description` `sch 2 part 2(D) para 9(b) the Retirement Benefits Schemes Supervisor of the Isle of Man - functions under the Retirement Benefits Schemes Act 2000` EQUALS "A disclosure for the purpose of enabling or assisting— (b) the Retirement Benefits Schemes Supervisor of the Isle of Man,"
-- (E) para 1(a): line(s) [19314, 19315] of the text
#ASSERT `sch 2 part 2 the words of the description` `sch 2 part 2(E) para 1(a) the European Central Bank` EQUALS "A disclosure for the purpose of enabling or assisting— (a) the European Central Bank, or"
-- (E) para 3: line(s) [19320] of the text
#ASSERT `sch 2 part 2 the words of the description` `sch 2 part 2(E) para 3 criminal proceedings in the British Islands or elsewhere` EQUALS "A disclosure with a view to the institution of, or otherwise for the purposes of, criminal proceedings in the British Islands or elsewhere."
-- (A) para 52, lawyer: sub-paragraph (1), line 19216
#ASSERT `sch 2 part 2 the words of the description` `sch 2 part 2(A) para 52 disciplinary proceedings about a lawyer` EQUALS "A disclosure with a view to the institution of, or otherwise for the purposes of, disciplinary proceedings relating to the performance by a lawyer, auditor, accountant, valuer or actuary of their professional duties."
-- no description: no words
#ASSERT `sch 2 part 2 the words of the description` `sch 2 part 2 none of the descriptions` EQUALS ""

